":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":32,"created_at":"2025-03-27T15:08:57Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:33Z","closed_at":"2025-07-04T17:41:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104696","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104696","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104696.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104696.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-04T17:41:41Z"},"body":"As discussed with @akien-mga the editor code is very cluttered, which makes it both difficult to assign code owners to, but also makes it hard to navigate\r\n\r\nOpening as a draft to discuss the specifics of how to organize things, where I still have some areas open for discussion:\r\n- [x] The structuring of sub folders of `/editor/`, currently these are organized mainly by type, not area, this could be changed to be more area specific (i.e. all dialogs are in `/editor/dialogs/` rather than specifically `/editor/animation/` etc.)\r\n- [x] If some files should be moved between sub folders, for example some files that are in `/editor/gui/` that might be better in `/editor/dialogs/`\r\n- [x] If some files that are under `/editor/plugins/` should be moved out of there and into the main sub folders, like the dialogs under `/editor/plugins/tiles/`\r\n- [X] How and if CODEOWNERS should be restructured, currently it uses relatively rough glob patterns to handle files, this could now be made more specific (this will be fixed in a follow up PR beyond the basic changes in this, which can be done without any noise)\r\n- [x] If we should use more relative paths, as you can see several paths were made more specific (including cases where the file references was moved to the same folder, making the specification unnecessary)\r\n\r\nGenerally looking for feedback on these specifics, but also generally, in my opinion this is badly needed to ensure the editor code remains manageable as it grows more complicated, currently the majority of files in `/editor/` lack owners, making review more complicated\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n* Supersedes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/83161\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104696/reactions","total_count":16,"+1":16,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104696/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}